{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7657143101424765203","title":"机械结构工程师（AG）-2027校招","description":"1、跟进复杂/大型模块级别的开发交付任务根据产品功能、需求进行系统分析，并形成合理的结构方案；\n2、根据设计任务书/Proposal，制定模块或整机的Spec要求，制定本模块的开发计划，进行方案设计，将任务拆解成模块，规范模块接口；\n3、根据选定方案，对细节进行设计，包括堆叠设计、分析、测试、验证；进行模具或加工DFM检讨，并优化设计；\n4、完成所负责的专利挖掘和撰写，风险识别与规避。","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历，机械、精密仪器、材料、飞行器、力学、车辆工程等任意与机械相关的专业，或非专业的优秀机械设计爱好者；\n2、了解注塑/压铸/机加/辅料的应用物性、工艺缺陷分析、选型；掌握DFM分析方法；\n3、熟悉制图软件，了解制图规范，能够独立完成简单零件的设计图和工程图；\n4、了解与结构耦合领域的设计类知识，例如PCB的加工工艺、贴片工艺等，注重知识的广度；\n5、有小型产品或复杂组件（例如充电管家)的结构设计经验者优先。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1782817775316,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7657141242913360147","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}